          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Our vision",
            "title": "To become India's most trusted name in everyday essentials.",
            "text": "Setting a new standard for how daily clothing is designed, worn and experienced, chosen for reliability and genuine preference rather than passing trends."
